    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.poster.avif?t=1667197911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.webm?t=1667197911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.mp4?t=1667197911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/5f6e708e6aca008dae70c034bb3c66dd.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br>Take the <strong>Watson-Scott</strong>\u2122 personality test and discover your deepest and darkest fears.<br><br>30 multiple-choice questions will help you decide if you're more afraid of clowns, snakes, or something more sinister... Are you a pathological liar or an empathic listener? Do you run from danger or take it head on? Do you <i>really</i> believe in ghosts?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/e51b23074628aba366d17aacdd103780.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique psychological horror experience that blurs the line between fact and fiction.<br></li><li> Accessible gameplay. Use your mouse to answer multiple-choice questions.<br></li><li> Creepy and suspenseful atmosphere, utilizing Steam's <i>3D spatial audio</i>, for truly unnerving scares.<br></li><li> Save a copy of your personal analysis to share with friends.<br></li><li> Procedurally generated questions with branching narrative. The test can be taken multiple times if you want to <i>explore the secrets</i> of the test itself...<br></li><li> Short playtime. 20 minutes to complete the test! <br></li><li> Steam achievements</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/179078fe50d694928136ac545e8aa833.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br>This is a very small game made by two programmers over a short period of time. We wanted to make an experience that was different to other horror games out there and blur the lines between the screen and the real world.<br><br>We appreciate your feedback and we're going to do our best to support this game as much as possible. Please don't hesitate to reach out if you have any problems or suggestions. We really hope you enjoy our game! &gt;:)<br><br>-Andy (<i>Normal Wholesome Games</i>)",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.poster.avif?t=1667197911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.webm?t=1667197911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/98fc2248b42201800171a938c30b193f.mp4?t=1667197911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/5f6e708e6aca008dae70c034bb3c66dd.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br>Take the <strong>Watson-Scott</strong>\u2122 personality test and discover your deepest and darkest fears.<br><br>30 multiple-choice questions will help you decide if you're more afraid of clowns, snakes, or something more sinister... Are you a pathological liar or an empathic listener? Do you run from danger or take it head on? Do you <i>really</i> believe in ghosts?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/e51b23074628aba366d17aacdd103780.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique psychological horror experience that blurs the line between fact and fiction.<br></li><li> Accessible gameplay. Use your mouse to answer multiple-choice questions.<br></li><li> Creepy and suspenseful atmosphere, utilizing Steam's <i>3D spatial audio</i>, for truly unnerving scares.<br></li><li> Save a copy of your personal analysis to share with friends.<br></li><li> Procedurally generated questions with branching narrative. The test can be taken multiple times if you want to <i>explore the secrets</i> of the test itself...<br></li><li> Short playtime. 20 minutes to complete the test! <br></li><li> Steam achievements</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955060/extras/179078fe50d694928136ac545e8aa833.webp?t=1667197911\" /></div><br>This is a very small game made by two programmers over a short period of time. We wanted to make an experience that was different to other horror games out there and blur the lines between the screen and the real world.<br><br>We appreciate your feedback and we're going to do our best to support this game as much as possible. Please don't hesitate to reach out if you have any problems or suggestions. We really hope you enjoy our game! &gt;:)<br><br>-Andy (<i>Normal Wholesome Games</i>)",
